umanity, or rather, the Central Government,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales1_05_e_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"oswald_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales1_05_e_47","text":"suspects that the second generation Grimms models were contaminated during the development stage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales1_05_e_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales1_05_e_48","text":"What a load of horsesh...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales1_05_e_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"oswald_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales1_05_e_49","text":"It's a perfectly reasonable concern.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales1_05_e_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"oswald_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales1_05_e_50","text":"Otherwise, how could Cinderella, who had never been deployed in actual combat,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales1_05_e_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"oswald_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales1_05_e_51","text":"have been corrupted and turned into Anachiro?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales1_05_e_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales1_05_e_52","text":"If you're harboring any doubts about me, spit it out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales1_05_e_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"oswald_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales1_05_e_53","text":"Very well. Yes, we do have our doubts about you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales1_05_e_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"oswald_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales1_05_e_54","text":"Yet you insist that you're innocent.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales1_05_e_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"oswald_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales1_05_e_55","text":"So, all you have to do is prove that fact to us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales1_05_e_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"redshoes","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales1_05_e_56","text":"... Is that all we need to do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales1_05_e_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"oswald_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales1_05_e_57","text":"No. There will be additional inspections,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales1_05_e_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"oswald_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales1_05_e_58","text":"including a brain scan.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales1_05_e_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"oswald_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales1_05_e_59","text":"This process is still in the development